  "notes": "Cambria Republicans elect precinct committee persons in gubernatorial-year primaries (the 2022 primary had 125 REP COMMITTEE PERSON contests, Vote For 2), so the May 19, 2026 primary is the most recent committee election. The county posts its 2026 primary official summary (dated 6.8.26) only as a file download on cambriacountypa.gov, which returns HTTP 403 to automated access (Cloudflare), so seat results could not be read; no 2026 primary Clarity page was linked. All 250 seats are unknown pending a manual download of that file. Precinct names are from the county Clarity results for the November 3, 2026 general election. The 2022 results were not used for seat status because they are superseded."
